SUMMARY:Computer Science & Mysticism
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nTopic:\n**Computer Scien
 ce and Mysticism -**\n**Atrium Group Ritual presented by Frank Nappi\, F.R
 .C.**\n\nAll AMORC members\, their families and friends of the Rosicrucian
  Order are welcome to attend. We are delighted to have you join us in ritu
 al and discussion.\n\n• Important to know- Doors open for members and no
 n-member friends of the Rosicrucian Order by 6:30 PM. Please arrive early!
  The Atrium Group ritual begins promptly at 7:00 PM. Members - please brin
 g your credentials or membership dues receipt.\n\nFollowing the meeting:\n
 1st Tuesday- Mystical Seekers Series Public Presentation at 8:00 PM\n\nThe
  Santa Rosa Pronaos operates under the law of AMRA. You may give as your h
 eart and mind direct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational
  non-profit\, an affiliated body of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge fo
 r the Americas and the Caribbean.
